    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just what people say to be nice. deep down i know it's not true. it's like there's a debt i owe for being a coward and there's no way to actually fix it. how can anyone say i \"deserve\" to be here when i've spent my whole life just existing while someone else paid the price for my silence?",
