    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like \"complexity\" though. it feels like a fact. like i'm just a parasite taking up air that someone else should have had. sometimes i think the only way to make things even is to just stop being a part of the world. like, if i wasn't here, the world would actually be a better, cleaner place. wouldn't you agree that some things just can't be fixed, they just need to be ended?",
